{"completed": true, "response": "既然他还不知道自己到底在怕什么，就不急着决定这份在意要走向哪里。他现在不必弄清楚两个人以后会怎样，也不必因为喜欢对方，就期待对方给自己什么回应。这样想着，他渐渐能够安心地和那个人亲近了。\n\n他很喜欢这种感觉。心里有一份温柔，想给对方就可以给，不用总去确认对方有没有感受到，也不必因为对方对自己很重要，就失去原本的从容和自在。有时候他甚至觉得，自己比以前更轻松了。原来让一个人走进心里，不一定就会让人感到不安；他可以认真地在乎对方，也不必非要抓住什么。\n\n这份快乐确实让他心里踏实了许多。他渐渐不再防着自己的喜欢，甚至有点满意自己竟然能够这么包容、不那么计较。如果两个人能一直这样自然地亲近，不用追问，也不用计较，那该多好。那时候，他觉得这样就已经足够了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7bb08d1e-c6b3-469c-8c76-d32eda210ac2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002116075722Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:21:24.449831+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1db2a531a52cae01c960e0f84b11cd8edb6055c6cdbdba524562935d1581aaaf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002116075722Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "85affe712bddbc23080481eda3454bc3d76e423a790268205a7de849a24f7eba"}}}
